@{
	NopHtml.AddTitleParts("The Wall of Shame - Airless Paint Sprayer Neglect");
	 NopHtml.AddMetaDescriptionParts("Pictures of airless paint sprayers that have been misused, neglected, or mistored - The Airless Sprayer Wall of Shame.");
	 NopHtml.AddMetaKeywordParts("airless paint sprayer neglect pump misuse pictures manifold filter cylinder rod");
}

<h1 class="h2 margin-block-end-4">The Airless Sprayer Wall of Shame</h1>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-4">
		<div class="card">
			<span class="bold h4">Also see</span>
			<ul class="list-unstyled">
				<li><a href=@Url.Action("TroubleShooting","Airless")>Sprayer Trouble Shooting</a></li>
				<li><a href=@Url.Action("Storage", "Airless")>Airless Storage</a></li>
				<li><a href=@Url.Action("Cleaning", "Airless")>Sprayer Cleaning</a></li>
				<li><a href=@Url.Action("Maintenance", "Airless")>Sprayer Maintenance</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		
	</div>
	<div class="col-md-8 order-first">
		<p> Like cars, airless paint sprayers require regular maintenance to keep them running well, reliable and long lasting. Keeping sprayers clean is an important first step. Below we have shown examples of what can happen if you have misused or abused your airless sprayer. Simple maintenance and cleaning steps can not only prevent your parts from looking like the ones below, but can also prevent costly repair bills. Don't abuse or neglect your sprayer... </p>
	</div>
	<div class="col-sm-12">
		<div class="row">
			<hr>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<h2>Filters</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-6">
				<img class="img-fluid" alt="Neglected Spray Gun Filter" src="../images/site/wall-o1.jpg" height="57" width="231">
				<p>&quot;Oh, there is a filter in the gun?&quot;</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-6">
				<img class="img-fluid" alt="Airless sprayer filter" src="../images/site/wall-o2.jpg" height="58" width="238">
				<p>&quot;Really, there is a filter in the sprayer too?&quot;</p>
			</div>
			<hr>
			<div class="clearfix"></div>
			<hr>
			<div class="col-sm-6">
				<img class="img-fluid" alt="Dirty Sprayer Manifold Filter" src="../images/site/wall-o6.jpg" height="100" width="230">
				<p>Another beautiful manifold filter.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-6">
				<img class="img-fluid" alt="Manifold filter covered in dry paint" src="../images/site/wall-o10.jpg" height="55" width="242">
				<p>&quot;You shouldn&#39;t leave paint in the sprayer huh?&quot;</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="row">
			<hr>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<h2>Rods &amp; Cylinders</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-6">
				<img class="img-fluid" alt="Piston rod as the result of dry stroking" height="43" src="../images/site/wall-o9.jpg" width="225">
				<p>
					Example of a rod dry stroking.
					<br>Can be caused from not using TSL and/or bad packings
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-6">
				<img class="img-fluid" alt="Broken Paint Sprayer Cylinder" height="101" src="../images/site/wall-o5.jpg" width="240">
				<p>&quot;Shouldn&#39;t cylinder be completely smooth?&quot;</p>
			</div>
			<div class="clearfix"></div>
			<hr>
			<div class="col-sm-12">
				<img class="img-fluid" alt="Graco Piston Rod" height="70" src="../images/site/wall-o3.jpg" width="223">
				<p>&quot;Throat Seal Liquid? What&#39;s that?&quot;</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="col-sm-12">
			<h2>The Rest</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="col-sm-6">
			<img class="img-fluid" alt="Broken Hose Clamped Together" height="58" src="../images/site/wall-o4.jpg" width="230">
			<p>&quot;I have repaired my airless hose but the clamps don&#39;t hold very long.&quot;</p>
		</div>
		<div class="col-sm-6">
			<img class="img-fluid" alt="Airless Sprayer Power Cord" height="106" src="../images/site/wall-o7.jpg" width="229">
			<p>&quot;What do you mean the extension cord may be too long and the wrong gauge? it&#39;s alternating current! You could run it across town if you wanted too!&quot;</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>